{"ticker":"BANDHANBNK","symbol":"BANDHANBNK","instrumentId":3155119,"name":"Bandhan Bank","industry":"NSE-Banks-Money Center","about":"Bandhan Bank, is a rapidly growing private sector bank in India, born out of a mission to provide last-mile banking to the unbanked and under-banked. Originating as an NGO and evolving into an NBFC before becoming a universal bank, Bandhan Bank is guided by the philosophy of 'Aapka Bhala. Sabki Bhalai.' (Your benefit. Everyone’s welfare.). The bank offers a comprehensive range of banking products and services, including loans, deposit accounts, internet and mobile banking, and ATM services, with a focus on semi-urban and rural customers. the bank serves 3.44 crore customers through 6,297 outlets, with deposits and advances totaling ₹2.59 lakh crore as of June 30, 2024.","website":"www.bandhan.bank.in","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:07:29.622Z","basis":"standalone","price":{"value":175,"changePct":2.9048571092555555,"week52High":216.74,"week52Low":135.47},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹28,195 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹25,014 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"1,015,027,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"332"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"748,013,789"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.86%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"1.1"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"2.2"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"56.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.09"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.74"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"9%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"15.13"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"9–425"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"4.8%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"7.09"},{"label":"Volume","value":"12,700,874"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"13,076,880"},{"label":"Master score","value":"66"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"86"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"64"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"26"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating","value":"A"}],